@startuml US2.2.10 - System Sequence Diagram
actor "Shipping Agent Representative" as Rep
participant "Port System" as System

' View own notifications
activate Rep
Rep -> System : Request to view own vessel visit notifications
activate System
System --> Rep : Display list of own notifications with status information
deactivate System

' View organization notifications
Rep -> System : Request to view all organization notifications
activate System
System --> Rep : Display list of organization notifications with status information
deactivate System

' Search and filter functionality
Rep -> System : Apply search/filter criteria (vessel, status, representative, time)
activate System
System --> Rep : Display filtered notification list
deactivate System

' View detailed status information
Rep -> System : Select specific notification to view details
activate System
alt Approved notification
    System --> Rep : Display notification details with dock information
else Rejected notification
    System --> Rep : Display notification details with rejection reason
else Other status
    System --> Rep : Display standard notification details
end
deactivate System
deactivate Rep

@enduml